<title>CHINA: Trading in Firstone Int'l shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Firstone Int'l shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Firstone International Holdings Ltd was suspended on Monday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.  </p>
<p>Firstone shares closed at HK$0.63 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
